    "detailed_description": "An old rusty key found deep in a cave, what could it open?<br>Explore a dense world, fight ferocious enemies, and solve puzzles in search for answers.<br><br>Master key features :<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Item based exploration<br></li><li> Dozens of enemies<br></li><li> Shops, weapons, and powerups<br></li><li> Dungeons<br></li><li> Between 5 and 20 hours of content<br></li><li> Lots of secrets<br></li><li> No language support!</li></ul><br>The game doesn't hold you by the hand, it's a love letter to hiking and exploration. You have to find your own path and nothing is story-gated.",
    "about_the_game": "An old rusty key found deep in a cave, what could it open?<br>Explore a dense world, fight ferocious enemies, and solve puzzles in search for answers.<br><br>Master key features :<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Item based exploration<br></li><li> Dozens of enemies<br></li><li> Shops, weapons, and powerups<br></li><li> Dungeons<br></li><li> Between 5 and 20 hours of content<br></li><li> Lots of secrets<br></li><li> No language support!</li></ul><br>The game doesn't hold you by the hand, it's a love letter to hiking and exploration. You have to find your own path and nothing is story-gated.",
    "short_description": "Master Key is a top-down adventure game with a strong focus on item-based exploration and secrets. Embark on a journey to discover what that key could be used for and meet colorful characters!",
